			"date": "2024-03-12T13:44:44.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>This is why. <a href=\"https://web.dev/articles/vitals-spa-faq\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">web.dev/articles/vitals-spa-fa</span><span class=\"invisible\">q</span></a></p><p>There is an implementation in Beta that you can try that would send CWV data on soft navigation. Worth a shot. I'm close to implementing it on a property and evaluating the results.</p>",
