			"date": "2024-03-12T13:55:25.748Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@ericheiken\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>ericheiken</span></a></span> that article is a little bit outdated (2021) but INP is mentioned there:</p><p>“We have already delivered a new metric named Interaction to Next Paint (INP) that measures interaction latency throughout the entire page lifecycle”</p><p>(but your point about initial load CWV metrics in SPA is well received)</p>",
